                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/5294: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chairman of the American
                        Delegation to the Sixth International Conference of American States</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Hughes</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-01-23T11:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 23,
                                1928—11 a.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>13. For White. For your information we telegraphed Munro as follows on Saturday.
                    Unless you see objection you may repeat this statement to Cuadra Pasos.</p>
                <p>[Here follows the text of telegram No. 24, January 21, 1928, 1 p.m., to the
                    Chargé in Nicaragua, printed on <ref target="#pg444">page 444</ref>.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
